


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_eb6a14b2:


    "晚上，屋里人都凑齐了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_5dc6a88d:


    "从澡堂回来的4人都在叠着各自洗好的东西。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_329fb9a2:


    "这个宿舍的洗衣机干燥机都在澡堂那边，所以很多人都是去洗澡时一起带上要洗的衣服过去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_164dc08f:



    voice "2MI_0822"
    miyako "「这个是？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_e8eee51e:


    "圣夜子从衣物篓里拿出一件很显眼的鲜艳衬衫。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_0f4b6736:



    voice "2HI_0867"
    hina "「啊，这件是篮球队穿的队服吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_abfd23f8:


    "敞开短袖后看到衣服正中央印着圣叶女子篮球部的队标。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_56b12ea4:



    voice "2MI_0823"
    miyako "「你今天去比赛时穿的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_ead9dd6c:



    voice "2HI_0868"
    hina "「嗯，今天开始用的新队服」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_d2b96b8a:



    voice "2FU_0722"
    fumi "「这样，怪不得感觉没见过呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_a7b033b3:



    voice "2MI_0824"
    miyako "「有没有垒球的队服？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_1df5b027:



    voice "2HI_0869"
    hina "「垒球穿的还是学校的，运动部的管理员会帮忙在学校的体育部公有的专用洗衣机里洗过」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_aa24d65d:



    voice "2FU_0723"
    fumi "「要是用家里的洗衣机，衣服上的土和沙子很容易弄坏机子呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_6a71501c:



    voice "2HI_0870"
    hina "「嗯，今天也是弄了一身土」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_c7681f61:


    "阳菜做了个滑垒的动作。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_e9f9099d:



    voice "2FU_0724"
    fumi "「好想看一次阳菜的比赛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_45a21a6d:



    voice "2MI_0825"
    miyako "「啊，我也想看」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_dde03599:



    voice "2HI_0871"
    hina "「想看哪个？篮球？田径？垒球？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_3ec1741b:



    voice "2FU_0725"
    fumi "「只要是阳菜擅长的就行」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_d1707040:



    voice "2HI_0872"
    hina "「全部都打的很好♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_e7345b28:



    voice "2RI_0857"
    rin "「这个衣服大小是定制的？啊，原来是小孩子款～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_1811e2ba:


    "伦如破冰船一般划入阳菜和文的二人世界，打开了阳菜的篮球队服。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f8d60acd:



    voice "2HI_0873"
    hina "「好，我们去屋顶1v1比试一下」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_9056d957:


    "阳菜准备起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_1aba3ab3:



    voice "2RI_0858"
    rin "「不、不是，阳菜。你这个身高竟然被排球和篮球队的叫去帮忙，不觉得很不一般吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_8d35b230:


    "确实，明明都是些对身高较高的人非常有利的竞技，阳菜却能成为队伍的主力，真的很厉害。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_5a40e823:



    voice "2RI_0859"
    rin "「你在赛场上是怎么和身高很高的人比赛的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f9793102:



    voice "2HI_0874"
    hina "「靠速度和运动量取胜」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_a97aa1b1:



    voice "2RI_0860"
    rin "「嗯～是不是因为胸部轻量化了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_61be01f2:



    voice "2HI_0875"
    hina "「火大——！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_1a26c345:



    voice "2FU_0726"
    fumi "「哇哇，危险危险」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_36f56d66:


    "正熨烫着大家外衣的文忙躲开战区。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f4a39e30:



    voice "2HI_0876"
    hina "「抱、抱歉，没事吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_3973735c:



    voice "2RI_0861"
    rin "「旺盛的运动量在狭窄的房间里反而不好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_30ec9db1:



    voice "2HI_0877"
    hina "「果然我们还是去屋顶一趟吧，让你见识见识没有限制的运动量是什么样子的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_44b0605c:



    voice "2RI_0862"
    rin "「不要不要，外面又黑又冷的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_5ce057e4:



    voice "2MI_0826"
    miyako "「果然胸大会重吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_c84e630d:


    "好直白。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_722a6d3c:



    voice "2FU_0727"
    fumi "「啊，那个……确实有时候跑起来会痛」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_bd715e6a:



    voice "2SA_0682"
    sachiko "「什么什么！？在聊胸？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_5702f897:


    "祥子突然插入话题。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_8fc701ec:



    voice "2FU_0728"
    fumi "「啊，你耳朵也太灵了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_c0369d7f:



    voice "2SA_0683"
    sachiko "「哎，真的在聊胸部吗？耶！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_ae71dce3:



    voice "2RI_0863"
    rin "「你高兴个什么。去屋顶！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_23f89eea:



    voice "2SA_0684"
    sachiko "「不要不要，我要聊胸部！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_dea5a125:



    voice "2HI_0878"
    hina "「没要事的话能不能请你回去？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f41662c7:



    voice "2SA_0685"
    sachiko "「有有我有事，我有，这个这个！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_9ccd74ea:


    "祥子挥了挥手上拿着的白色的物件。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_d109f0f0:



    voice "2MI_0827"
    miyako "「是什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_785b6f9b:



    voice "2FU_0729"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_621d6037:


    "只有文看出了是什么。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_689d3480:



    voice "2SA_0686"
    sachiko "「我看到小文的胸罩落在衣物篓里了，就帮忙拿回来了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_31cfe372:



    voice "2MI_0828"
    miyako "「为什么你知道是文的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_a9af26b3:



    voice "2SA_0687"
    sachiko "「住宿舍会穿这么大的也就小文了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f206fb00:



    voice "2RI_0864"
    rin "「啊～我懂」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f2936003:



    voice "2FU_0730"
    fumi "「………！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_64cacf76:


    "大家的视线全部聚集到文的胸上后，文忙用双臂遮挡住胸部。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_2b3d2540:



    voice "2HI_0879"
    hina "「不准用肮脏的眼神看小文！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_1b083dcb:


    "把内衣收到衣箱里，稍稍松口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_b493bd5e:



    voice "2FU_0731"
    fumi "「谢谢你帮我拿回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_2eb9d90b:



    voice "2SA_0688"
    sachiko "「嗯，要谢我就让我的脸在胸上——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_1ce634ee:



    voice "2HI_0880"
    hina "「嗯哼哼哼哼」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_54e44503:



    voice "2SA_0689"
    sachiko "「小文这个尺寸的不太好买吧，是不是比较贵？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f32ba90b:


    "眼瞅着阳菜要咬上来，祥子忙换话题。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_ad2b491d:



    voice "2FU_0732"
    fumi "「是的，而且很少遇到打折，还没有什么好看的款式……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_7ddda0a2:


    "文很少见的认真说道。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_04c30f71:



    voice "2RI_0865"
    rin "「我的尺寸正好是优惠尺寸，种类也很多」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_05329d82:



    voice "2FU_0733"
    fumi "「呜呜……好羡慕」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_c58de99b:



    voice "2RI_0866"
    rin "「圣夜夜的还勉强有一些款式」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_ac9c6053:



    voice "2MI_0829"
    miyako "「这么大的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_7e32206c:


    "圣夜子双手托起胸。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_da0df668:



    voice "2RI_0867"
    rin "「噗唔……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_b9dad95d:



    voice "2MI_0830"
    miyako "「？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_b8a71820:


    "顺带一提圣夜子身上穿的内衣是圣诞节时和三人一起去买的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_409674d6:


    "她是突然住进宿舍的，没带更换的内衣。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_a42acaa6:



    voice "2HI_0881"
    hina "「小文穿什么样的内衣都很可爱」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_c6196251:



    voice "2FU_0734"
    fumi "「唔，谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_e69a2405:



    voice "2RI_0868"
    rin "「浅生这么大的肯定要穿啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_d600dd24:



    voice "2FU_0735"
    fumi "「是的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_06719700:



    voice "2SA_0690"
    sachiko "「阳菜就——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_54d5afcd:



    voice "2HI_0882"
    hina "「不给你看！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_481af901:



    voice "2FU_0736"
    fumi "「穿的时候，那里被收紧托起来时不是很舒服呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f41b5a84:



    voice "2RI_0869"
    rin "「而且你用的背扣挺宽的，起码有三四个扣吧，第一次看到时还以为你穿的紧身胸衣呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_4b3f4c76:



    voice "2FU_0737"
    fumi "「嗯，真的……所以我每次回房间脱了后会觉得很轻松，圣夜子的也不小呢，没事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_3e66960c:



    voice "2MI_0831"
    miyako "「嗯，我也是觉得憋屈不是很想穿，但上体育课时一般都会穿上，不然运动时会晃动得不好跑步了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_845cba17:


    "啊，这家伙——"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_d811f2bb:



    voice "2FU_0738"
    fumi "「圣夜子，在屋里倒没什么，但出门时还是穿上内衣吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_dfab464c:



    voice "2MI_0832"
    miyako "「啊，好的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_295ade78:



    voice "2SA_0691"
    sachiko "「这么说来，好羡慕阳菜啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_f7cac145:



    voice "2HI_0883"
    hina "「羡慕什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_4ef255b7:



    voice "2SA_0692"
    sachiko "「因为你可以随便摸小文的胸啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_9d672927:



    voice "2RI_0870"
    rin "「我懂，我非常懂」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_527cdc38:



    voice "2HI_0884"
    hina "「所—以—说！不要讲下流的话！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_93b4558c:



    voice "2SA_0693"
    sachiko "「哎？你们是情侣啊？那这有什么的，很正常的话题啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_5cb80a93:



    voice "2HI_0885"
    hina "「这、这……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_d7b060e8:



    voice "2FU_0739"
    fumi "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_9f404ea9:


    "两人互相看着对方红起脸来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_0e3a30e5:



    voice "2RI_0871"
    rin "「反正阳菜大概就只是像婴儿一样吮吸胸吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_94a5975f:



    voice "2HI_0886"
    hina "「……哎，啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_9b740919:


    "事实如此，没什么可反驳的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_9d5305e9:



    voice "2RI_0872"
    rin "「哎？怎么……这里不是该吐槽我的吗？这样显得我好像说了严重性骚扰的话题啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_c2b5c43b:



    voice "2SA_0694"
    sachiko "「伦～～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_0b68a56c:



    voice "2MI_0833"
    miyako "「对了，祥子姐穿什么样的胸罩？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_dd9f9cbd:



    voice "2SA_0695"
    sachiko "「这样的——」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_9d2fc8e0:



    voice "2RI_0873"
    rin "「不用扒出来看的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_d0e3d598:



    voice "2HI_0887"
    hina "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_8f93372e:



    voice "2FU_0740"
    fumi "「…………」"




translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_ff7c41c0:


    voice "2HI_0869"


translate simplified_chinese a09_cou1_03_95a94b49:


    hina "「垒球穿的还是学校的，运动部的管理员会帮忙在学校的体育部公有的专用洗衣机里洗过」"
